      "message": "I think this should be an Adapter toggle, not instance, similar to UseDXC, and initialized in `PhysicalDevice::SetupBackendAdapterToggles` for D3D12. In that function, I would Default to true if `DAWN_USE_AGILITY_SDK`, else false.\n\nWith this change, I think we should modify the code so that if `Toggle::UseAgilitySDK` is enabled, we assume that the Agility SDK must be available, and do not do any fallback logic. So when creating a device, if `Toggle::UseAgilitySDK` is enabled, we use the factory and expect it to succeed.",
